{"seq":2,"slug":"compiler-and-parser","title":"编译原理与解析器","stage":"DONE","category":"editors-compilers","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser","rating":{"composite":4.38,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 编译原理与解析器 简介\n\n编译器是将一种语言转换为另一种语言的程序，而解析器则是编译器前端的核心组件。从词法分析到语法解析，从抽象语法树到中间表示，再到最终的代码生成与优化——理解这一完整管线，是深入掌握编程语言工具链的关键。无论你是想编写 Babel 插件、构建 ESLint 规则、实现 DSL，还是理解 TypeScript 编译器的内部运作，编译原理都提供了不可替代的理论基础与工程方法论。\n\n本知识库面向有一定编程经验、希望系统理解编译器与解析器工作原理的开发者。内容以 TypeScript 为主要代码语言，在涉及类型理论与函数式抽象时引入 Haskell 示例作为对比，在讨论高性能解析时引入 Rust 示例作为参考。\n\n全书共分五个章节：\n\n第一章**词法分析**从 Token 类型设计出发，深入有限自动机理论，探讨正则语言在编译器中的角色，覆盖词法错误恢复与 Unicode 感知的词法解析。\n\n第二章**语法解析理论**系统讲解递归下降、PEG 与 Packrat、LR/GLR 等主流解析算法，以及面向编辑器的错误恢复策略。\n\n第三章**AST 与 IR**聚焦抽象语法树的设计模式、CST 与 AST 的权衡、中间表示（SSA、CFG）的原理，以及类型检查与名称解析等语义分析基础。\n\n第四章**代码生成**涵盖 AST 到目标代码的转换策略、优化 Pass 的设计、Source Map 规范，以及面向 WebAssembly 的编译方案。\n\n第五章**实战编译器**将理论融入工程实践，包括从零构建一门小语言、TypeScript 编译器 API、Babel 插件体系，以及 ESLint 规则与 Codemod 的编写。\n\n建议按章节顺序学习。前两章建立编译器前端的完整知识体系，第三章连接前端与后端，第四章深入后端工程，第五章将所有知识转化为可落地的开发能力。如果你已有编译原理基础，可直接跳到第三章或第五章。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lexical-analysis","title":"词法分析","docCount":4,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/lexical-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tokenizer-design","title":"词法分析器设计","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/lexical-analysis/tokenizer-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"regular-languages","title":"正则语言","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/lexical-analysis/regular-languages"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lexer-error-recovery","title":"词法错误恢复","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/lexical-analysis/lexer-error-recovery"},{"seq":4,"slug":"unicode-and-encoding","title":"Unicode 与编码","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/lexical-analysis/unicode-and-encoding"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"parsing-theory","title":"语法解析理论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/parsing-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"recursive-descent","title":"递归下降解析","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/parsing-theory/recursive-descent"},{"seq":2,"slug":"peg-and-packrat","title":"PEG 与 Packrat 解析","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/parsing-theory/peg-and-packrat"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lr-and-glr","title":"LR 与 GLR 解析","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/parsing-theory/lr-and-glr"},{"seq":4,"slug":"error-recovery-in-parsing","title":"解析错误恢复","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/parsing-theory/error-recovery-in-parsing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ast-and-ir","title":"AST 与 IR","docCount":4,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/ast-and-ir","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ast-design","title":"AST 设计","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/ast-and-ir/ast-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"concrete-vs-abstract","title":"CST 与 AST","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/ast-and-ir/concrete-vs-abstract"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intermediate-representations","title":"中间表示","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/ast-and-ir/intermediate-representations"},{"seq":4,"slug":"semantic-analysis","title":"语义分析","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/ast-and-ir/semantic-analysis"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成","docCount":4,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/code-generation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"code-generation-basics","title":"代码生成基础","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/code-generation/code-generation-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"optimization-passes","title":"优化 Pass","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/code-generation/optimization-passes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"source-maps","title":"Source Map 源码映射","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/code-generation/source-maps"},{"seq":4,"slug":"wasm-code-generation","title":"WebAssembly 代码生成","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/code-generation/wasm-code-generation"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"practical-compilers","title":"实战编译器","docCount":4,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/practical-compilers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"building-a-language","title":"构建一门语言","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/practical-compilers/building-a-language"},{"seq":2,"slug":"typescript-compiler-api","title":"TypeScript 编译器 API","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/practical-compilers/typescript-compiler-api"},{"seq":3,"slug":"babel-plugin-system","title":"Babel 插件体系","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/practical-compilers/babel-plugin-system"},{"seq":4,"slug":"linting-and-codemods","title":"Lint 与 Codemod","url":"/h/editors-compilers/compiler-and-parser/practical-compilers/linting-and-codemods"}]}]}